const [from,to]=rg,dow=d=>new Date(d+'T12:00:00').getDay(),we=d=>[0,6].includes(dow(d)),dates=[];for(let d=from,g=0;d<=to&&g++<160;d=wlDateAdd(d,1))if(WS.weekends||!we(d))dates.push(d);
document.getElementById('wlPeriodLabel').innerHTML=fmtDate(from)+' –<br>'+fmtDate(to);
